('b13091de-2010-5033-8340-70027780e8ba','d02777ab-30dc-5d33-a193-08ffcb2d9cac',1,'adjective','A2','S1','W1','( comparative heavier , superlative heaviest )','[{"phrase":"be heavy on something","register":"informal","definition_en":"to use a lot or too much of something","translation":"استفاده زیاد یا زیاد از چیزی","example":"The car’s rather heavy on oil.","example_translation":"روغن ماشین نسبتا سنگینه","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001352478.mp3"},{"phrase":"make heavy weather of something","register":null,"definition_en":"to make something that you are doing seem more difficult or complicated than it really is – used to show disapproval","translation":"برای اینکه کاری را که انجام می دهید دشوارتر یا پیچیده تر از آنچه هست به نظر بیاورید - برای نشان دادن عدم تایید استفاده می شود","example":"Why does he need to make such heavy weather of a simple task?","example_translation":"چرا او باید چنین هوای سنگین را از یک کار ساده بسازد؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734423.mp3"},{"phrase":"with a heavy heart","register":"literary","definition_en":"feeling very sad","translation":"احساس بسیار غمگین","example":"It was with a heavy heart that Kate said goodbye.","example_translation":"کیت با دلی سنگین خداحافظی کرد.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001352580.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
