('a304a1f4-acbc-5fb5-98eb-428c3309ab49','bf6c448f-5328-5d38-9d3c-0290f0c5182c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to be exactly the same in size, number, or amount as something else','[ linking verb ]',null,'برابر بودن، مساوی بودن (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Two plus two equals four.","translation":"دو بعلاوه دو برابر است با چهار.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501041.mp3"},{"sentence":"Prices become more stable when supply equals demand.","translation":"زمانی که عرضه برابر با تقاضا باشد، قیمت ها پایدارتر می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501042.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('85577421-2bb9-5154-83dc-cb84b24f002f','bf6c448f-5328-5d38-9d3c-0290f0c5182c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to be as good as something else, or get to the same standard as someone or something else','[ transitive ]',null,'خوب بودن به اندازه چیز دیگری، یا رسیدن به استانداردهای مشابه با شخص یا چیز دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Thompson equalled the world record.","translation":"تامپسون با رکورد جهانی برابری کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501047.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('04c71346-3550-5997-b73d-6751c700efe1','bf6c448f-5328-5d38-9d3c-0290f0c5182c',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be equalled (only) by something','برابر بودن، مساوی بودن (با)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c4d9d664-eb78-5bfd-9a34-bcf22f1394bb','bf6c448f-5328-5d38-9d3c-0290f0c5182c',4,null,null,'spoken & written','to produce a particular result or effect','[ transitive ]',null,'برای ایجاد یک نتیجه یا اثر خاص','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A highly-trained workforce equals high productivity.","translation":"نیروی کار بسیار آموزش دیده برابر با بهره وری بالا است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501052.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('580c9910-db98-59b9-9209-3641a437a327','3ea55bd0-f203-54c1-a065-f4297dab3daf',1,null,null,'spoken & written','someone who is as important, intelligent etc as you are, or who has the same rights and opportunities as you do',null,null,'کسی که به اندازه شما مهم، باهوش و غیره است، یا از حقوق و فرصت های مشابه شما برخوردار است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He treats all his staff as equals.","translation":"او با تمام کارکنانش مثل هم رفتار می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001501213.mp3"},{"sentence":"a friendship between equals","translation":"دوستی بین افراد برابر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642203.mp3"},{"sentence":"She wasn’t his equal in intelligence.","translation":"او از نظر هوشی برابر با او نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642206.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('097862ea-fddc-5c69-95bc-181c5a6d44ba','3ea55bd0-f203-54c1-a065-f4297dab3daf',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be the equal of somebody/something',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2fa47cf7-61b8-560e-813a-9f75af850b14','3ea55bd0-f203-54c1-a065-f4297dab3daf',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be without equal',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('3db2a77e-cffb-5584-b1a3-ef857b6888ba','8ba0958f-5f5f-51fe-b4bb-f596f86c78d6',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a mistake','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'خطا، اشتباه؛ کد خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make an error We made too many errors, and that cost us the game.','commit an error formal (= make an error, especially a serious one ) He knew he had committed a grave error of judgement.','have/contain an error If the data contains errors, the results will be wrong.','find/spot/notice an error His accountant spotted several errors in his tax return.','realize your error By the time she realized her error, it was too late.','correct an error ( also rectify an error formal ) We will rectify the error as soon as possible.','avoid errors He resolved to learn from his mistakes and avoid similar errors in the future.','compound an error (= make it worse ) He refused to listen to our advice, which compounded the error.','an error arises/occurs formal (= happens ) If an error occurs, you will have two more chances to re-enter your password.','a common error a common error which students often make when writing essays','a serious/bad error The police made a serious error, which resulted in a young man’s death.','a small/minor error The letter contained some minor spelling errors.','a glaring error (= very bad and very noticeable ) There is a glaring error on page 10, where his date of death is given as 2053, not 1003.','a huge/monumental error (= very serious ) It was a monumental error to attack from the north.','a grave error (= extremely serious, with serious results ) He has committed a grave error.','a fatal error (= extremely serious, so that you are certain to fail ) Telling your staff they are not important is a fatal error.','an unfortunate error An unfortunate error resulted in confidential information being released to the press.','a grammatical/spelling/typing error You lose marks if your paper contains spelling errors.','a clerical/administrative error The applications forms were sent to the wrong addresses due to a clerical error.','a factual error (= which includes a fact that is wrong ) The article contains many factual errors.','a tactical error (= one that may cause a plan to fail ) Both parties have made tactical errors in the run-up to the election.','a random error (= one that is not like others or part of a pattern ) This may seem like a random error, but in fact it is repeated once in every 5,000 samples.','human error (= errors made by people ) Automatic checks reduce the danger of human error.','computer error An on-board computer error meant that the plane’s systems shut down for a few vital seconds.','pilot/driver error Investigators believe the crash was caused by pilot error.','somebody’s past errors formal If we fail to learn from our past errors, we are doomed to repeat them.','a margin of error (= the degree to which a calculation might be wrong ) We have to allow for a small margin of error in the calculations.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There must be an error in our calculations.","translation":"حتماً در محاسبات ما خطایی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642354.mp3"},{"sentence":"There must be a mistake somewhere.","translation":"حتما یه جایی اشتباه شده","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,2),
('22f5a2dc-6e90-56fb-a249-7d3ae38ff97d','8ba0958f-5f5f-51fe-b4bb-f596f86c78d6',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a mistake when you are working on a computer, which means that the computer program cannot do what you want it to do','[ countable ]',null,'یک اشتباه در هنگام کار بر روی کامپیوتر، به این معنی که برنامه کامپیوتری نمی تواند کاری را که شما می خواهید انجام دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['make an error We made too many errors, and that cost us the game.','commit an error formal (= make an error, especially a serious one ) He knew he had committed a grave error of judgement.','have/contain an error If the data contains errors, the results will be wrong.','find/spot/notice an error His accountant spotted several errors in his tax return.','realize your error By the time she realized her error, it was too late.','correct an error ( also rectify an error formal ) We will rectify the error as soon as possible.','avoid errors He resolved to learn from his mistakes and avoid similar errors in the future.','compound an error (= make it worse ) He refused to listen to our advice, which compounded the error.','an error arises/occurs formal (= happens ) If an error occurs, you will have two more chances to re-enter your password.','a common error a common error which students often make when writing essays','a serious/bad error The police made a serious error, which resulted in a young man’s death.','a small/minor error The letter contained some minor spelling errors.','a glaring error (= very bad and very noticeable ) There is a glaring error on page 10, where his date of death is given as 2053, not 1003.','a huge/monumental error (= very serious ) It was a monumental error to attack from the north.','a grave error (= extremely serious, with serious results ) He has committed a grave error.','a fatal error (= extremely serious, so that you are certain to fail ) Telling your staff they are not important is a fatal error.','an unfortunate error An unfortunate error resulted in confidential information being released to the press.','a grammatical/spelling/typing error You lose marks if your paper contains spelling errors.','a clerical/administrative error The applications forms were sent to the wrong addresses due to a clerical error.','a factual error (= which includes a fact that is wrong ) The article contains many factual errors.','a tactical error (= one that may cause a plan to fail ) Both parties have made tactical errors in the run-up to the election.','a random error (= one that is not like others or part of a pattern ) This may seem like a random error, but in fact it is repeated once in every 5,000 samples.','human error (= errors made by people ) Automatic checks reduce the danger of human error.','computer error An on-board computer error meant that the plane’s systems shut down for a few vital seconds.','pilot/driver error Investigators believe the crash was caused by pilot error.','somebody’s past errors formal If we fail to learn from our past errors, we are doomed to repeat them.','a margin of error (= the degree to which a calculation might be wrong ) We have to allow for a small margin of error in the calculations.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an error message","translation":"یک پیام خطا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001642369.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('208141d5-0efe-5723-b11b-77af0bce68aa','8ba0958f-5f5f-51fe-b4bb-f596f86c78d6',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'error of judgment','خطا، اشتباه؛ کد خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('01bab865-949f-5cb5-a637-ee51acb18150','8ba0958f-5f5f-51fe-b4bb-f596f86c78d6',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'be in error','خطا، اشتباه؛ کد خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('52d3c5fa-a630-561e-8b33-3ee29e8277b5','8ba0958f-5f5f-51fe-b4bb-f596f86c78d6',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'do something in error','خطا، اشتباه؛ کد خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('5df06d76-831a-5c32-a67e-9646391c777d','8ba0958f-5f5f-51fe-b4bb-f596f86c78d6',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'see the error of your ways','خطا، اشتباه؛ کد خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f7327c38-ff37-5a7e-9c6c-e3d0ea9e487b','5cd0cf16-cc23-556a-9f38-89b98b2d3d2b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a short piece of writing about a particular subject by a student as part of a course of study',null,null,'انشا، مقاله (دانش‌آموز)؛ کوشش (تلاش برای)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['write/do an essay I’ve got a 3,000 word essay to write before Friday.','give in/hand in an essay Half the class failed to hand in their essay on time.','mark an essay British English , grade an essay American English: I went home knowing that I still had a pile of essays to mark.','read an essay Did you read her essay on ‘The Waste Land’?','an English/history/politics etc essay He got a good grade for his English essay.','a critical essay (= one that judges how good a book, writer etc is ) The anthology contains critical essays by Kael, Graham Greene and others.','an academic essay Mature students often need practice writing academic essays.','a literary essay In a literary essay, you should explore the meaning and construction of the text.','an essay question We practised essay questions from previous exam papers.','an essay title You will find a list of essay titles on the notice board.','an essay topic Students will be given six essay topics, from which they must choose two.','a collection of essays She published a collection of essays on philosophy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"an essay on Bernard Shaw","translation":"مقاله ای در مورد برنارد شاو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001219106.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4ebea62a-43ef-55f9-85e1-6b8dc8b8fa29','5cd0cf16-cc23-556a-9f38-89b98b2d3d2b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a short piece of writing giving someone’s ideas about politics , society etc',null,null,'یک قطعه کوتاه از نوشتار که ایده های کسی را در مورد سیاست، جامعه و غیره ارائه می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['write/do an essay I’ve got a 3,000 word essay to write before Friday.','give in/hand in an essay Half the class failed to hand in their essay on time.','mark an essay British English , grade an essay American English: I went home knowing that I still had a pile of essays to mark.','read an essay Did you read her essay on ‘The Waste Land’?','an English/history/politics etc essay He got a good grade for his English essay.','a critical essay (= one that judges how good a book, writer etc is ) The anthology contains critical essays by Kael, Graham Greene and others.','an academic essay Mature students often need practice writing academic essays.','a literary essay In a literary essay, you should explore the meaning and construction of the text.','an essay question We practised essay questions from previous exam papers.','an essay title You will find a list of essay titles on the notice board.','an essay topic Students will be given six essay topics, from which they must choose two.','a collection of essays She published a collection of essays on philosophy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Rousseau’s ‘Essay on the Origin of Languages’","translation":"مقاله روسو درباره خاستگاه زبان ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001614538.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9f11913b-cf88-52c9-a415-87a8205e076b','5cd0cf16-cc23-556a-9f38-89b98b2d3d2b',3,null,null,'formal','an attempt to do something',null,null,'تلاش برای انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('33d87aac-9cf9-584e-8c1f-7fbaaf299fec','938d3855-2d11-5710-9a19-b9bfa28a5b2f',1,null,null,'formal','to attempt to do something',null,null,'تلاش برای انجام کاری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c0cb6bfb-4bec-5568-86bd-54a72d8c4798','2274a93c-9be8-574e-a2b7-8567e9e449ad',1,'interesting/exciting','جالب/مهیج','spoken & written','something that happens, especially something important, interesting or unusual','[ countable ]',null,'رویداد، حادثه؛ مسابقه (ورزشی)؛ رخداد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a big/major event (= important ) Getting married is a major event in anyone’s life.','an important/significant event It’s natural to be nervous before such an important event.','a momentous event (= very important ) the momentous events of 9/11','a historic event (= very important in a country’s history ) The signing of the peace treaty was a historic event.','a dramatic event (= very exciting ) The dramatic events will be brought to you live on BBC.','a tragic event (= very sad ) Let’s not talk about the tragic events of the past.','a traumatic event (= very upsetting ) He was forced to relive the traumatic events of his kidnap.','a common/an everyday event The death of a child was a common event in those days.','a rare/unusual event A sighting of a white deer is a rare event.','recent events Recent events in the country have caused great concern.','the latest events We will be bringing you news of all the latest events.','current events There are some similarities between what happened in the 1920s and current events in the US.','an event happens/takes place ( also an event occurs formal ) The event took place last year.','events unfold (= happen, usually in an exciting or unexpected way ) I watched the dramatic events unfold from my window.','events lead (up) to something (= cause something ) His assassination was one of the events that led to the First World War.','the events surrounding something (= the events that are closely related to a situation ) The events surrounding her death remain a mystery.','celebrate/commemorate/mark an event (= do something to show that you remember it ) Fans observed a minute’s silence to commemorate the tragic event.','witness an event (= see it happen ) Luckily, a film crew were on the spot to witness the event.','record an event (= write down or photograph what happened ) Two photographers recorded the events.','a series/sequence of events (= related events that happen one after the other ) The incident was the first in a series of events that finally led to his arrest.','a chain of events (= a series of events where each one causes the next ) He set in motion a chain of events that he couldn’t control.','the course of events (= the way in which a series of events happens ) Nothing you could have done would have changed the course of events.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"one of the most important events in the history of mankind","translation":"یکی از مهمترین وقایع تاریخ بشریت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554031.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('5643f918-663e-5b6d-81cb-3b47d532d342','2274a93c-9be8-574e-a2b7-8567e9e449ad',2,'social gathering','گردهمایی اجتماعی','spoken & written','a performance , sports competition , party etc at which people gather together to watch or take part in something','[ countable ]',null,'یک اجرا، مسابقه ورزشی، مهمانی و غیره که در آن افراد دور هم جمع می شوند تا چیزی را تماشا کنند یا در آن شرکت کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The conference was an important social event (= an event at which people can meet each other ) .","translation":"کنفرانس یک رویداد اجتماعی مهم بود (= رویدادی که در آن مردم می توانند یکدیگر را ملاقات کنند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643070.mp3"},{"sentence":"one of the major sporting events of the year","translation":"یکی از مهمترین رویدادهای ورزشی سال","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001586129.mp3"},{"sentence":"The school raises money by organizing fundraising events.","translation":"مدرسه با سازماندهی رویدادهای جمع آوری کمک مالی جمع آوری می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001223197.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('122ea6d7-66df-5dbb-af30-cc22544c20f4','2274a93c-9be8-574e-a2b7-8567e9e449ad',3,'race/competition','مسابقه/مسابقه','spoken & written','one of the races or competitions that are part of a large sports competition','[ countable ]','field event , three-day event','یکی از مسابقات یا مسابقاتی که بخشی از یک مسابقه ورزشی بزرگ است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The next event will be the 100 metres.","translation":"مسابقه بعدی 100 متر خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001223203.mp3"},{"sentence":"The 800 metres is not his best event.","translation":"800 متر بهترین مسابقه او نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643079.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
