('861285f3-f52d-57b8-8738-00213b3fbe0f','76328400-9733-5ad9-8ff4-5e64d9639104',1,null,null,'spoken & written','completely correct in every detail',null,null,'دقیق، تمام‌کامن (جزئیات)؛ بی‌خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the exact amount/number/figure I don’t know the exact amount, but it was a lot.','the exact size First, cut a piece of wood about 1cm x 10cm – the exact size doesn’t matter.','the exact date He plans to retire soon, but the exact date is not fixed.','the exact time/moment At that exact moment, the phone rang.','the exact position/location/spot etc The satellite pictures showed the enemy’s exact location.','an exact copy/replica (= something which has been made, that is exactly like another thing ) The vessel is an exact replica of a Viking longboat.','an exact equivalent (= something that has exactly the same meaning, purpose, value etc as something else ) There is no exact equivalent in English for the phrase.','an exact match (= something that is exactly the same as something else ) The two DNA samples were an exact match.','the exact details (= details that are correct in every way ) Nobody knows the exact details of what happened.','somebody’s exact words (= the words someone actually said ) Try to remember his exact words – it’s very important.','the exact wording (= the words that were used in a letter, speech, etc, with nothing changed ) What was the exact wording of the message?','the exact same thing/way etc informal (= exactly the same thing/way etc ) If you’d been there, you’d have done the exact same thing.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police are still investigating the exact cause of the accident.","translation":"پلیس همچنان در حال بررسی علت دقیق این حادثه است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224181.mp3"},{"sentence":"What were his exact words?","translation":"دقیقا حرفش چی بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734748.mp3"},{"sentence":"The timing had to be exact.","translation":"زمان باید دقیق باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734749.mp3"},{"sentence":"The exact location of the hostages is unknown.","translation":"محل دقیق گروگان ها مشخص نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224180.mp3"},{"sentence":"I know her birthday’s in July, but I can’t remember the exact date.","translation":"من می دانم تولد او در ماه جولای است، اما تاریخ دقیق آن را به خاطر نمی آورم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734754.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s not an exact copy, but most people wouldn’t notice the difference.","translation":"این یک کپی دقیق نیست، اما اکثر مردم تفاوت را متوجه نمی شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001224184.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some concepts in Chinese medicine have no exact equivalent in Western medicine.","translation":"برخی از مفاهیم در طب چینی معادل دقیقی در طب غربی ندارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001734755.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('215ca443-22d9-5be2-988e-dae695e9b5e6','76328400-9733-5ad9-8ff4-5e64d9639104',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'to be exact','دقیق، تمام‌کامن (جزئیات)؛ بی‌خطا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the exact amount/number/figure I don’t know the exact amount, but it was a lot.','the exact size First, cut a piece of wood about 1cm x 10cm – the exact size doesn’t matter.','the exact date He plans to retire soon, but the exact date is not fixed.','the exact time/moment At that exact moment, the phone rang.','the exact position/location/spot etc The satellite pictures showed the enemy’s exact location.','an exact copy/replica (= something which has been made, that is exactly like another thing ) The vessel is an exact replica of a Viking longboat.','an exact equivalent (= something that has exactly the same meaning, purpose, value etc as something else ) There is no exact equivalent in English for the phrase.','an exact match (= something that is exactly the same as something else ) The two DNA samples were an exact match.','the exact details (= details that are correct in every way ) Nobody knows the exact details of what happened.','somebody’s exact words (= the words someone actually said ) Try to remember his exact words – it’s very important.','the exact wording (= the words that were used in a letter, speech, etc, with nothing changed ) What was the exact wording of the message?','the exact same thing/way etc informal (= exactly the same thing/way etc ) If you’d been there, you’d have done the exact same thing.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
