('e023613b-3199-5a1a-8447-2695b2f3322d','d17a6081-103a-5880-8180-e9e72c600d77',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to happen or be present in a particular situation or place',null,null,'موجود بودن، بودن؛ رخ دادن؛ (باقی) ماندن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['really/actually exist Do you think ghosts really exist?','already exist Legislation to protect us from terrorists already exists.','currently exist No treaty currently exists between the two countries.','still exist (= existing in the past and continuing to exist ) A number of his early photographs still exist.','continue to exist We all hope the human race will continue to exist for millions of years.','cease to exist (= stop existing ) Many of these companies will cease to exist in five years'' time.','be known to exist Seven copies of the original book are still known to exist.','the right to exist The president issued a statement recognizing Kosovo''s right to exist.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The custom of arranged marriages still exists in many countries.","translation":"رسم ازدواج های ترتیب داده شده هنوز در بسیاری از کشورها وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001229911.mp3"},{"sentence":"Opportunities exist for students to gain sponsorship.","translation":"فرصت‌هایی برای دانش‌آموزان برای کسب حمایت مالی وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611936.mp3"},{"sentence":"Stop pretending that the problem doesn’t exist.","translation":"از تظاهر به اینکه مشکل وجود ندارد دست بردارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611937.mp3"},{"sentence":"The club will cease to exist if financial help is not found.","translation":"اگر کمک مالی پیدا نشود، باشگاه وجود خود را از دست خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001611938.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('61fd5e23-f922-57c1-b829-1e5c8c0e2335','d17a6081-103a-5880-8180-e9e72c600d77',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to be real or alive',null,null,'واقعی بودن یا زنده بودن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['really/actually exist Do you think ghosts really exist?','already exist Legislation to protect us from terrorists already exists.','currently exist No treaty currently exists between the two countries.','still exist (= existing in the past and continuing to exist ) A number of his early photographs still exist.','continue to exist We all hope the human race will continue to exist for millions of years.','cease to exist (= stop existing ) Many of these companies will cease to exist in five years'' time.','be known to exist Seven copies of the original book are still known to exist.','the right to exist The president issued a statement recognizing Kosovo''s right to exist.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do fairies really exist?","translation":"آیا پری واقعا وجود دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001229905.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tom acts as if I don’t exist at times.","translation":"تام طوری رفتار می کند که انگار من گاهی وجود ندارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001229907.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('a3672bf3-17c6-5c0f-bc8c-f8db77ab4890','d17a6081-103a-5880-8180-e9e72c600d77',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to stay alive, especially in a difficult situation when you do not have enough money, food etc',null,null,'برای زنده ماندن، به خصوص در شرایط سخت که پول، غذا و غیره کافی ندارید',array['survive']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['really/actually exist Do you think ghosts really exist?','already exist Legislation to protect us from terrorists already exists.','currently exist No treaty currently exists between the two countries.','still exist (= existing in the past and continuing to exist ) A number of his early photographs still exist.','continue to exist We all hope the human race will continue to exist for millions of years.','cease to exist (= stop existing ) Many of these companies will cease to exist in five years'' time.','be known to exist Seven copies of the original book are still known to exist.','the right to exist The president issued a statement recognizing Kosovo''s right to exist.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The hostages existed on bread and water.","translation":"گروگان ها روی نان و آب وجود داشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001229917.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('763adb28-a12b-599a-9cb5-466b63d728af','a2a5e9e8-4a86-5f14-9285-9048b0216115',1,null,null,'spoken & written','more of something, in addition to the usual or standard amount or number','[ only before noun ]',null,'اضافی، فوق‌العاده؛ اضافه‌کاری؛ (کیفیت) ویژه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Could you get an extra loaf of bread?","translation":"آیا می توانید یک قرص نان اضافی تهیه کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001202484.mp3"},{"sentence":"Allow extra time for your journey.","translation":"زمان بیشتری را برای سفر خود در نظر بگیرید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000548.mp3"},{"sentence":"Drivers are advised to take extra care .","translation":"به رانندگان توصیه می شود بیشتر مراقب باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001202485.mp3"},{"sentence":"Residents can use the gym at no extra cost .","translation":"ساکنین می توانند بدون هزینه اضافی از سالن بدنسازی استفاده کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001202486.mp3"},{"sentence":"I asked for an extra two weeks to finish the work.","translation":"من دو هفته دیگر خواستم تا کار را تمام کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001202489.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('be46b52b-7c7c-55c4-a646-98365b69d1e1','a2a5e9e8-4a86-5f14-9285-9048b0216115',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if something is extra, it is not included in the price of something and you have to pay more for it','[ not before noun ]',null,'اگر چیزی اضافه باشد در قیمت چیزی لحاظ نمی شود و باید برای آن هزینه بیشتری پرداخت کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Dinner costs $15 but wine is extra.","translation":"هزینه شام ​​15 دلار است اما شراب اضافی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627815.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c237b2cd-c61a-559d-9e82-b9f4058942f2','2434c4d5-b92a-5019-9763-7f3720e35754',1,null,null,'spoken & written','in addition to the usual things or the usual amount',null,null,'علاوه بر چیزهای معمول یا مقدار معمول','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They need to offer something extra to attract customers.","translation":"آنها باید چیزهای اضافی را برای جذب مشتری ارائه دهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627477.mp3"},{"sentence":"I got a few extra in case anyone else decides to come.","translation":"من چند تا اضافی گرفتم در صورتی که شخص دیگری تصمیم بگیرد بیاید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627480.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll be making $400 extra a month.","translation":"من ماهانه 400 دلار اضافی درآمد خواهم داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627481.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('51ba5c5b-6a97-5731-aaff-b48ccae18a23','2434c4d5-b92a-5019-9763-7f3720e35754',2,null,null,'spoken & written','used to emphasize an adjective or adverb','[ +adj/adverb ]',null,'برای تأکید بر یک صفت یا قید استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"You’re going to have to work extra hard to pass the exam.","translation":"برای قبولی در امتحان باید بیشتر تلاش کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627486.mp3"},{"sentence":"an extra special effort","translation":"یک تلاش ویژه اضافی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627487.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('524568f9-8b7b-52ff-a303-f07816e5b3d4','4e4ed136-137b-5f4c-868c-4d2146450153',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of something, especially money, in addition to the usual, basic, or necessary amount',null,null,'مقداری از چیزی، به ویژه پول، علاوه بر مقدار معمول، اساسی یا ضروری',array['more']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I earn extra for working on Sunday.","translation":"من برای کار در روز یکشنبه درآمد اضافی دارم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001202499.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c3500a94-8535-5fcc-8bcf-156153aa9e4b','dadb2b8e-f563-5d40-b416-f552af51fe54',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something which is added to a basic product or service that improves it and often costs more',null,null,'چیزی که به یک محصول یا خدمات اساسی اضافه می شود که آن را بهبود می بخشد و اغلب هزینه بیشتری دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Tinted windows and a sunroof are optional extras (= something that you can choose to have or not ) .","translation":"پنجره های رنگی و سانروف اضافی اختیاری هستند (= چیزی که می توانید انتخاب کنید که داشته باشید یا نداشته باشید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001202524.mp3"},{"sentence":"Be careful, there may be hidden extras (= additional charges which you are not told about ) .","translation":"مراقب باشید، ممکن است موارد اضافی پنهان وجود داشته باشد (= هزینه های اضافی که به شما گفته نشده است).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627821.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s got lots of useful little extras .","translation":"این دارای بسیاری از موارد اضافی مفید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627826.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('7f4519e2-7425-580d-878d-19c7533b8789','dadb2b8e-f563-5d40-b416-f552af51fe54',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an actor in a film who does not say anything but is part of a crowd',null,null,'بازیگر فیلمی که چیزی نمی گوید اما جزئی از جمعیت است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He started his acting career as an extra.","translation":"او حرفه بازیگری خود را به عنوان یک فرد اضافی آغاز کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001627830.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('086d88f1-2b64-52ed-81e2-f707127a46fa','1d10b545-940d-5e4e-af98-9e6d98b2e57b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','outside or beyond',null,null,'خارج یا فراتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"extragalactic (= outside our galaxy )","translation":"فرا کهکشانی (= خارج از کهکشان ما)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832333.mp3"},{"sentence":"extracellular (= outside a cell )","translation":"خارج سلولی (= خارج از سلول)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001832335.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
