('089a6e86-4a02-58b9-8529-9f23e4bf82f0','9e71ce7c-f66c-5fd0-a4fe-4acc71d63a73',1,'farm','مزرعه','spoken & written','an area of land in the country, especially one where crops are grown or animals feed on grass',null,null,'زمین، مزرعه؛ رشته (دانش)؛ میدان (نظامی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a corn/wheat/rice etc field In summer the rice fields were lush and green.','an open field I saw a fox run across the open field.','a green field All around the house were green fields and rolling hills.','an arable field (= one used for growing crops ) Barley was growing in the arable fields surrounding the castle.','a cultivated field (= one with crops growing on it ) The valley is an area of lush greenery and cultivated fields.','a ploughed field It was difficult walking across the ploughed field.','a field of corn/wheat/rice etc The road was surrounded by fields of corn.','plough a field (= make long deep lines in the ground so that you can grow crops ) The farmer was using a tractor to plough the field.','work in the fields (= do farm work ) Most villagers work in the fields during the day.','cross a field We crossed the field and came to the barn.','walk across a field I walked across the field to the gate.','cows/horses etc graze in a field (= they eat the grass growing there ) Cattle were grazing in the field below.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a view of green fields and rolling hills","translation":"نمایی از مزارع سرسبز و تپه های غلتان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643343.mp3"},{"sentence":"a field of wheat","translation":"یک مزرعه گندم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001606301.mp3"},{"sentence":"working in the cotton fields","translation":"کار در مزارع پنبه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001643349.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
