nline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824131.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8c989f7d-e63a-5a83-9463-e3e2a42b4259','ac0de163-616e-5af9-9ca1-0b622c80e91e',4,'ocean/forest/cave floor etc','اقیانوس / جنگل / کف غار و غیره','spoken & written','the ground at the bottom of the ocean , the forest etc',null,null,'زمین در کف اقیانوس، جنگل و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['clean the floor Next he had to clean the floor.','wash/mop the floor The floor needs mopping.','sweep the floor He grabbed a broom and began sweeping the floor.','wax/polish the floor I washed and waxed the kitchen floor.','sit/lie/sleep on the floor Officers found her lying face down on the floor.','fall/drop/sink to the floor He let his cigarette fall to the floor.','the bathroom/kitchen/bedroom etc floor I’ve still got to clean the bathroom floor.','a wooden floor The hut had a muddy wooden floor.','a marble floor He strode across the marble floor.','a tiled floor There were a couple of oriental rugs on the tiled floor.','a carpeted floor Barbara was sitting on the carpeted floor.','a bare floor (= not covered by anything ) Father Murphy led me to a tiny room with a bare floor and a simple bed.','floor tiles (= flat square pieces of clay or other material, used to cover floors ) When you buy floor tiles, always get a few extra.','floor polish The room smelt of floor polish.','a floor covering (= a material, such as carpet, that covers a floor ) A carpet fitter can fit floor coverings quickly and inexpensively.','floor space (= a measure of how big a room or building is, based on the size of the floor ) The shop has 33,000 square feet of floor space.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"creatures that live on the ocean floor","translation":"موجوداتی که در کف اقیانوس زندگی می کنند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001299832.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('b521c29f-3e29-5988-a572-ab94d6e01e19','ac0de163-616e-5af9-9ca1-0b622c80e91e',5,'for dancing','برای رقصیدن','spoken & written','an area in a room where people can dance',null,null,'منطقه ای در اتاقی که مردم می توانند در آن برقصند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['clean the floor Next he had to clean the floor.','wash/mop the floor The floor needs mopping.','sweep the floor He grabbed a broom and began sweeping the floor.','wax/polish the floor I washed and waxed the kitchen floor.','sit/lie/sleep on the floor Officers found her lying face down on the floor.','fall/drop/sink to the floor He let his cigarette fall to the floor.','the bathroom/kitchen/bedroom etc floor I’ve still got to clean the bathroom floor.','a wooden floor The hut had a muddy wooden floor.','a marble floor He strode across the marble floor.','a tiled floor There were a couple of oriental rugs on the tiled floor.','a carpeted floor Barbara was sitting on the carpeted floor.','a bare floor (= not covered by anything ) Father Murphy led me to a tiny room with a bare floor and a simple bed.','floor tiles (= flat square pieces of clay or other material, used to cover floors ) When you buy floor tiles, always get a few extra.','floor polish The room smelt of floor polish.','a floor covering (= a material, such as carpet, that covers a floor ) A carpet fitter can fit floor coverings quickly and inexpensively.','floor space (= a measure of how big a room or building is, based on the size of the floor ) The shop has 33,000 square feet of floor space.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There were two or three couples already on the dance floor .","translation":"دو یا سه زوج از قبل روی زمین رقص بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001706125.mp3"},{"sentence":"Everyone took to the floor for the last waltz.","translation":"همه برای آخرین والس روی زمین رفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001824135.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('65df5a86-45ca-54cf-9f9e-d46fd8618b91','ac0de163-616e-5af9-9ca1-0b622c80e91e',6,'where people work','جایی که مردم کار می کنند','spoken & written','a large area in a building where a lot of people do their jobs',null,null,'یک منطقه بزرگ در یک ساختمان که در آن افراد زیادی کار خود را انجام می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['clean the floor Next he had to clean the floor.','wash/mop the floor The floor needs mopping.','sweep the floor He grabbed a broom and began sweeping the floor.','wax/polish the floor I washed and waxed the kitchen floor.','sit/lie/sleep on the floor Officers found her lying face down on the floor.','fall/drop/sink to the floor He let his cigarette fall to the floor.','the bathroom/kitchen/bedroom etc floor I’ve still got to clean the bathroom floor.','a wooden floor The hut had a muddy wooden floor.','a marble floor He strode across the marble floor.','a tiled floor There were a couple of oriental rugs on the tiled floor.','a carpeted floor Barbara was sitting on the carpeted floor.','a bare floor (= not covered by anything ) Father Murphy led me to a tiny room with a bare floor and a simple bed.','floor tiles (= flat square pieces of clay or other material, used to cover floors ) When you buy floor tiles, always get a few extra.','floor polish The room smelt of floor polish.','a floor covering (= a material, such as carpet, that covers a floor ) A carpet fitter can fit floor coverings quickly and inexpensively.','floor space (= a measure of how big a room or building is, based on the size of the floor ) The shop has 33,000 square feet of floor space.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He wasn’t keen on the idea of working on the shop floor (= the part of a factory where people make things using machines ) .","translation":"او علاقه‌ای به کار در کف مغازه (= بخشی از کارخانه که در آن مردم با ماشین‌ها چیزهایی می‌سازند) نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001706129.mp3"},{"sentence":"the busy trading floor (= area where stocks and shares are bought and sold )","translation":"محل معاملات شلوغ (= منطقه ای که سهام و سهام در آن خرید و فروش می شود)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000615.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
