('c51b2674-14da-50fe-83d5-6cbab645c6de','8a61b919-78f8-5798-a7ce-b34568d4132f',1,null,null,'formal','to give someone something or allow them to have something that they have asked for',null,null,'اعطا کردن، اختصاص دادن؛ اجازه دادن؛ اذعان کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Britain could grant Spain’s request .","translation":"بریتانیا می تواند درخواست اسپانیا را بپذیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710721.mp3"},{"sentence":"I would love to be able to grant her wish.","translation":"خیلی دوست دارم بتوانم آرزویش را برآورده کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710722.mp3"},{"sentence":"The council have granted him permission to build on the site.","translation":"شورا به او اجازه ساخت در این سایت را داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710725.mp3"},{"sentence":"A licence to sell alcohol was granted to the club.","translation":"مجوز فروش الکل به باشگاه داده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710728.mp3"},{"sentence":"Grant that we may know your presence and love.","translation":"عطا کن که حضور و محبت شما را بدانیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710732.mp3"},{"sentence":"They gave him permission to stay.","translation":"به او اجازه ماندن دادند.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,6),
('191ca54d-0f27-55d5-ad68-e975e29cc92d','8a61b919-78f8-5798-a7ce-b34568d4132f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to admit that something is true although it does not make much difference to your opinion',null,null,'اعتراف به اینکه چیزی درست است، هر چند تفاوت چندانی با نظر شما ندارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s got talent, I grant you , but he doesn’t work hard enough.","translation":"او استعداد دارد، من به شما می دهم، اما او به اندازه کافی سخت کار نمی کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710733.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('54c58205-9a3b-5a7a-a354-19cef0a1cdd5','8a61b919-78f8-5798-a7ce-b34568d4132f',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'take it for granted (that)','اعطا کردن، اختصاص دادن؛ اجازه دادن؛ اذعان کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f8d8ba3c-0e84-5212-9fce-00412bd86333','8a61b919-78f8-5798-a7ce-b34568d4132f',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'take somebody/something for granted','اعطا کردن، اختصاص دادن؛ اجازه دادن؛ اذعان کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6930f0ad-58c0-52dd-9e2d-2746341fae47','1e1d3df7-7656-5421-803a-854ed05d7aba',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of money given to someone, especially by the government, for a particular purpose',null,null,'بورس، بورس (تحصیلی)؛ رضایت (رسمی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a government grant The school has won a £240,000 government grant to improve its science and technology areas.','a research grant He received a research grant to study the effect of pollution on the environment.','a student grant If you are on a low income, you may be able to get a student grant.','a block grant American English (= money given by the central government to state governments in order to pay for services such as the police, roads etc ) Congress approved block grants for education, health, and social services.','a grant of £5,000, $8,000 etc The library received a grant of $20,000 to improve its computer facilities.','apply for a grant We could apply for a grant and start a serious research programme.','be eligible for a grant (= be allowed to receive a grant ) This booklet explains who is eligible to receive a grant.','get/obtain a grant You may be able to get a grant to learn a trade.','receive a grant It is likely that you will receive a grant to cover your tuition.','give/award somebody a grant If you have been awarded a grant, you must send the details to the university.','be funded by a grant The expansion of the computer department was funded by a government grant.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The university gets a government grant.","translation":"دانشگاه کمک هزینه دولتی دریافت می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001332718.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anyone wishing to apply for a grant should write to the Treasurer.","translation":"هر کسی که مایل به درخواست کمک هزینه است باید به خزانه دار نامه بنویسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710711.mp3"},{"sentence":"a grant of £50,000","translation":"کمک هزینه 50000 پوندی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710717.mp3"},{"sentence":"These studios are funded by a grant from the Kress Foundation.","translation":"بودجه این استودیوها با کمک مالی بنیاد کرس تامین می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001710720.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b32ffe5c-6280-58de-bc89-f821f6f1eca0','45d5d0ca-19c7-5090-91eb-65332b8a6f72',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a drawing that uses a line or lines to show how two or more sets of measurements are related to each other',null,null,'نمودار خطی، نمودار (رایانه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a bar graph (= a picture of boxes of different heights, in which each box represents a different amount or quantity ) The monthly variations in rainfall are shown on the bar graph below.','a line graph A line graph is a way of presenting figures in visual form.','draw a graph Draw a graph to show changes in the death rate over this period.','plot something on a graph (= to draw marks or a line to show facts, numbers etc on a graph ) The different values can be plotted on a graph.','show something on a graph/a graph shows something The graph shows that wages rose in line with productivity.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Martin showed me a graph of their recent sales.","translation":"مارتین نموداری از فروش اخیر آنها را به من نشان داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001333496.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('610ea2e4-5782-5b9d-b0d2-40f935c6d864','e59b79dc-ca8c-510b-8497-e7c9d3da0a46',1,'in fields and gardens','در مزارع و باغ ها','spoken & written','a very common plant with thin leaves that covers the ground in fields and gardens and is often eaten by animals','[ uncountable ]',null,'چمن، علف؛ چمن (زمین بازی)؛ علف‌زار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cut the grass The grass in the back garden needs cutting.','mow the grass (= cut it with a special machine ) I usually mow the grass once a week.','green The cows moved slowly through the long green grass.','tall/long I walked with the tall grass brushing my knees.','short These mowers only work efficiently on short grass.','coarse (= consisting of thick and large pieces ) The only vegetation was a few bushes and patches of coarse grass.','damp/wet His foot slipped on the wet grass and he fell.','grass clippings/cuttings (= pieces of cut grass ) You can use your grass clippings to start your own compost pile.','grass stains (= marks on clothing caused by grass ) It''s going to be difficult to get the grass stains out of these trousers.','grass seed Now is the best time to plant grass seed.','grass verge British English (= area of grass next to a road ) He stopped the car on the grass verge of the deserted road.','a blade of grass (= a single piece of grass ) A few blades of grass poked out of the dry earth.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She enjoyed the feel of grass beneath her feet.","translation":"او از احساس چمن زیر پایش لذت می برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001333761.mp3"},{"sentence":"a blade of grass (= single leaf )","translation":"یک تیغ علف (= تک برگ)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001333760.mp3"},{"sentence":"All grasses need light to grow well.","translation":"همه علف ها برای رشد خوب نیاز به نور دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001333766.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('085868b9-8e29-5a18-aa7b-2dcd22564b25','e59b79dc-ca8c-510b-8497-e7c9d3da0a46',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the grass','چمن، علف؛ چمن (زمین بازی)؛ علف‌زار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cut the grass The grass in the back garden needs cutting.','mow the grass (= cut it with a special machine ) I usually mow the grass once a week.','green The cows moved slowly through the long green grass.','tall/long I walked with the tall grass brushing my knees.','short These mowers only work efficiently on short grass.','coarse (= consisting of thick and large pieces ) The only vegetation was a few bushes and patches of coarse grass.','damp/wet His foot slipped on the wet grass and he fell.','grass clippings/cuttings (= pieces of cut grass ) You can use your grass clippings to start your own compost pile.','grass stains (= marks on clothing caused by grass ) It''s going to be difficult to get the grass stains out of these trousers.','grass seed Now is the best time to plant grass seed.','grass verge British English (= area of grass next to a road ) He stopped the car on the grass verge of the deserted road.','a blade of grass (= a single piece of grass ) A few blades of grass poked out of the dry earth.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
