('5c8cab50-a232-56d4-826b-8537aa73a9cd','ec58d945-acca-5af0-b71f-c0acf5346d7b',1,'body organ','اندام بدن','spoken & written','the organ in your chest which pumps blood through your body','[ countable ]',null,'قلب؛ مرکز (شهر)؛ دل‌وگیان (طرفدار)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['somebody’s heart beats Her heart was beating fast.','somebody’s heart pounds/thuds/thumps (= it beats very strongly ) He reached the top, his heart pounding.','somebody’s heart races (= it beats very fast ) Was there someone in the alley? Joe’s heart began to race.','heart trouble/problems You should not take this medication if you have heart problems.','heart disease Smoking increases the risk of heart disease.','a heart condition (= something wrong with your heart ) The baby was born with a heart condition.','somebody’s heart rate (= the number of times someone’s heart beats per minute ) Your heart rate increases as you exercise.','healthy Eating oily fish can help maintain a healthy heart.','a bad/weak heart (= an unhealthy heart ) The effort proved too much for her weak heart.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Regular exercise is good for the heart.","translation":"ورزش منظم برای قلب مفید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967018.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you hear my heart beating ?","translation":"صدای ضربان قلبم را می شنوی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967019.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her cheeks were hot and her heart was pounding .","translation":"گونه هایش داغ بود و قلبش می تپید .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967025.mp3"},{"sentence":"My heart raced . Were we going to land safely?","translation":"قلبم تند تند زد قرار بود به سلامت فرود بیاییم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967029.mp3"},{"sentence":"Daniel had no history of heart problems .","translation":"دانیل هیچ سابقه مشکل قلبی نداشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967033.mp3"},{"sentence":"She suffers from a rare heart condition .","translation":"او از یک بیماری نادر قلبی رنج می برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967037.mp3"},{"sentence":"His breathing and heart rate were now normal.","translation":"اکنون تنفس و ضربان قلب او عادی شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001967041.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('bebbda3c-d656-5e5f-b23a-90acc87719f8','ec58d945-acca-5af0-b71f-c0acf5346d7b',2,'emotions/love','احساسات/عشق','spoken & written','the part of you that feels strong emotions and feelings','[ countable ]',null,'بخشی از شما که احساسات و عواطف قوی را احساس می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His heart was full of anger and grief.","translation":"دلش پر از خشم و غم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001351084.mp3"},{"sentence":"The plight of the refugees had tugged at the nation’s heart.","translation":"وضعیت اسفبار پناهندگان قلب ملت را به خود مشغول کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757855.mp3"},{"sentence":"The doctor had an extremely kind heart.","translation":"دکتر قلب فوق العاده مهربانی داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757856.mp3"},{"sentence":"She could hardly speak for the ache in her heart .","translation":"او به سختی می توانست برای درد قلبش صحبت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757857.mp3"},{"sentence":"It would break Kate’s heart (= make her extremely sad ) to leave the lovely old house.","translation":"ترک خانه قدیمی دوست داشتنی قلب کیت را می شکند (= او را به شدت غمگین می کند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757863.mp3"},{"sentence":"He left the country with a heavy heart (= great sadness ) .","translation":"با دلی سنگین (= غم بزرگ) کشور را ترک کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757870.mp3"},{"sentence":"Edith loved her boy with all her heart and soul .","translation":"ادیت پسرش را با تمام وجودش دوست داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757875.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was still pretty innocent then when it came to affairs of the heart (= matters relating to love and sex ) .","translation":"در آن زمان من هنوز در مورد امور قلبی (= مسائل مربوط به عشق و جنسی) بی گناه بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757879.mp3"},{"sentence":"a woman with a heart of gold (= very kind character )","translation":"زنی با قلب طلایی (= شخصیت بسیار مهربان)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757884.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sometimes I think he’s got a heart of stone (= very cruel character ) .","translation":"گاهی اوقات فکر می کنم او یک قلب سنگی دارد (= شخصیت بسیار بی رحمانه).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757888.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m glad I followed my heart rather than my head for once.","translation":"خوشحالم که برای یک بار هم که شده به جای قلبم دنبال قلبم رفتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757893.mp3"},{"sentence":"My father told me never to let my heart rule my head .","translation":"پدرم به من گفت هرگز اجازه نده قلبم بر سرم حکومت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002096139.mp3"},{"sentence":"He thinks of himself as a warm-hearted and caring human being.","translation":"او خود را انسانی خونگرم و دلسوز می داند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001757902.mp3"}]'::jsonb,13),
