('9614acdb-59e7-5e5a-9849-895ff1082093','da38bfa2-8b10-57c5-a77e-a2f230dacf28',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to suggest that something is true , without saying this directly',null,null,'دلالت کردن، به‌طور ضمنی رساندن؛ معنا دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Cleo blushed. She had not meant to imply that he was lying.","translation":"کلیو سرخ شد. او قصد نداشت بگوید که او دروغ می گوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001406279.mp3"},{"sentence":"an implied threat","translation":"یک تهدید ضمنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001406280.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('67310f43-4187-5af1-93b6-d5365d3bd67c','da38bfa2-8b10-57c5-a77e-a2f230dacf28',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if a fact , event etc implies something, it shows that it is likely to be true',null,null,'اگر یک واقعیت، رویداد و غیره دلالت بر چیزی داشته باشد، نشان می دهد که احتمالاً درست است',array['suggest']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The high level of radiation in the rocks implies that they are volcanic in origin.","translation":"سطح بالای تشعشع در سنگ ها نشان می دهد که منشا آتشفشانی دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001406289.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7968c6e1-b317-5a5f-93ab-314d5b372353','da38bfa2-8b10-57c5-a77e-a2f230dacf28',3,null,null,'spoken & written','if one thing implies another, it proves that the second thing exists',null,null,'اگر چیزی دلالت بر چیز دیگری داشته باشد، ثابت می کند که چیز دوم وجود دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Democracy implies a respect for individual liberties.","translation":"دموکراسی به معنای احترام به آزادی های فردی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001406293.mp3"},{"sentence":"High profits do not necessarily imply efficiency.","translation":"سود بالا لزوماً به معنای کارایی نیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001709413.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('012aa95f-6f98-59aa-83ba-cef367cdd5a8','67725ab9-9432-5f3c-be86-00e044b5dc42',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an alphabetical list of names , subjects etc at the back of a book , with the numbers of the pages where they can be found',null,null,'فهرست الفبایی، نمایه؛ شاخص (بازار)؛ اِکس (نارنجی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c534623e-0e38-57d3-9345-69c5955a0dfe','67725ab9-9432-5f3c-be86-00e044b5dc42',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a set of cards or a database containing information , usually arranged in alphabetical order and used especially in a library',null,null,'مجموعه ای از کارت ها یا یک پایگاه داده حاوی اطلاعات، معمولاً به ترتیب حروف الفبا مرتب شده و به ویژه در یک کتابخانه استفاده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('99388862-928c-520d-9c2d-e0db56672579','67725ab9-9432-5f3c-be86-00e044b5dc42',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a standard by which the level of something can be judged or measured',null,null,'معیاری که بر اساس آن می توان سطح چیزی را قضاوت یا سنجید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The changing size of an infant’s head is considered an index of brain growth.","translation":"تغییر اندازه سر یک نوزاد شاخص رشد مغز در نظر گرفته می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733691.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6db15385-bc0c-557e-8626-b83b35bc452b','67725ab9-9432-5f3c-be86-00e044b5dc42',4,null,null,'technical','a system by which prices , costs etc can be compared to those of a previous date',null,null,'سیستمی که توسط آن می توان قیمت ها، هزینه ها و غیره را با تاریخ های قبلی مقایسه کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('dd2cacca-fb84-5469-8a40-84f7421d7923','3744e819-aced-5fc9-8af7-9a407abe096c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if documents , information etc are indexed, an index is made for them',null,null,'اگر اسناد، اطلاعات و غیره نمایه شوند، فهرستی برای آنها ساخته می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The reports are indexed by subject and location.","translation":"گزارش ها بر اساس موضوع و مکان نمایه می شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733697.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('24e45946-2c3e-5f58-8b57-d366a27b7227','3744e819-aced-5fc9-8af7-9a407abe096c',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to arrange for the level of wages , pension s etc to increase or decrease according to the level of prices',null,null,'ترتیبی دهد که سطح دستمزدها، حقوق بازنشستگی و غیره با توجه به سطح قیمت ها افزایش یا کاهش یابد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"demands that wages be indexed to the rise in prices","translation":"خواستار این است که دستمزدها با افزایش قیمت ها شاخص شود","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001834297.mp3"},{"sentence":"an amount indexed for inflation","translation":"مقدار شاخص تورم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001733703.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c372ab71-f98c-5b25-a3f7-d1b9ca8ff23f','7133d6f8-ab9d-53f9-ae8f-569679d0d2cc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','on the inside or close to the centre of something',null,null,'درونی، درونی (دور، بخش)؛ باطنی (روح)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an inner room","translation":"یک اتاق داخلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413682.mp3"},{"sentence":"inner London","translation":"لندن داخلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413683.mp3"},{"sentence":"the inner ear","translation":"گوش داخلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413684.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('98cd6d2f-85f5-53ed-b8af-52a13b47aeeb','7133d6f8-ab9d-53f9-ae8f-569679d0d2cc',2,null,null,'spoken & written','inner thoughts or feelings are ones that you feel strongly but do not always show to other people',null,null,'افکار یا احساسات درونی آنهایی هستند که شما به شدت آنها را احساس می کنید اما همیشه آنها را به دیگران نشان نمی دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Yoga gives me a sense of inner calm.","translation":"یوگا به من احساس آرامش درونی می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001413693.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’ll need great inner strength to get over the tragedy.","translation":"او برای غلبه بر این تراژدی به قدرت درونی زیادی نیاز دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750933.mp3"},{"sentence":"She never shared her inner thoughts with anyone.","translation":"او هرگز افکار درونی خود را با کسی در میان نمی گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750934.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('10e174f8-3992-5834-ac4a-f409c5d97c02','7133d6f8-ab9d-53f9-ae8f-569679d0d2cc',3,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to things which happen or exist but are not easy to see',null,null,'مربوط به چیزهایی است که اتفاق می افتد یا وجود دارد، اما دیدن آنها آسان نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the inner workings of the film industry","translation":"درونیات صنعت فیلم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750935.mp3"},{"sentence":"the fascinating inner life of a political party","translation":"زندگی درونی جذاب یک حزب سیاسی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750936.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('30ceb338-f718-5e19-a1d1-20ed34c95beb','7133d6f8-ab9d-53f9-ae8f-569679d0d2cc',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'inner circle','درونی، درونی (دور، بخش)؛ باطنی (روح)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('d6db5d5c-695d-58b4-b595-a14aa4523b99','7133d6f8-ab9d-53f9-ae8f-569679d0d2cc',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'somebody’s inner voice','درونی، درونی (دور، بخش)؛ باطنی (روح)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('13bfbf81-7c9d-5fec-9d51-7ebdd2fb566a','abfcc432-6f8b-5e8d-89e1-092a27105158',1,null,null,'spoken & written','information that is put into a computer','[ uncountable ]',null,'داده ورودی، ورودی (رایانه)؛ مشارکت (نظر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"If the input data specified it, the file will close and the process terminates.","translation":"اگر داده های ورودی آن را مشخص کرده باشند، فایل بسته می شود و فرآیند خاتمه می یابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001840959.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ef9a27e9-a014-58a2-8f14-0696c7626ae6','abfcc432-6f8b-5e8d-89e1-092a27105158',2,null,null,'spoken & written','ideas, advice , money, or effort that you put into a job or activity in order to help it succeed','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'ایده‌ها، توصیه‌ها، پول یا تلاشی که در یک کار یا فعالیت انجام می‌دهید تا به موفقیت آن کمک کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Farmers contributed most of the input into the survey.","translation":"کشاورزان بیشتر ورودی ها را در این نظرسنجی سهیم کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001750999.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’ll need input from community nurses.","translation":"ما به نظرات پرستاران جامعه نیاز داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751002.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('6e5131e1-e255-5ee9-baa2-f739ec7dd6b0','abfcc432-6f8b-5e8d-89e1-092a27105158',3,null,null,'technical','electrical power that is put into a machine for it to use','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'نیروی الکتریکی که در دستگاه قرار می گیرد تا از آن استفاده کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('9ce357af-2799-559a-b086-5970c8180fda','b7649743-3f6a-5996-9022-fd18e6ceb55b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to put information into a computer',null,null,'برای قرار دادن اطلاعات در کامپیوتر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The information is input to our computer system.","translation":"اطلاعات به سیستم کامپیوتری ما وارد می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001751007.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0c3c2715-b12a-596b-adda-739727d4722f','a122cbe4-a9af-5f4f-a81d-6e75beb3c95d',1,'subject/problem','موضوع/مشکل','spoken & written','a subject or problem that is often discussed or argued about, especially a social or political matter that affects the interests of a lot of people','[ countable ]',null,'موضوع، مسئله؛ شماره (مجله)؛ صدور (سهام)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['discuss/debate an issue They met to discuss the issue of working conditions at the factory.','raise an issue/bring up an issue (= say an issue should be discussed ) Some important issues were raised at the meeting.','deal with/tackle an issue ( also address an issue formal ) The government must deal with the issue of gun crime. The company said that it will address the issue at the next scheduled board meeting.','decide/settle/resolve an issue (= solve it ) The issue was settled after some tough negotiations. No deadline has been set to resolve the issue.','face an issue (= accept that an issue exists and deal with it ) Politicians seem to be reluctant to face the issue.','avoid/evade an issue ( also dodge/duck an issue informal ) (= avoid discussing an issue ) There is no point in evading the issue any longer.','confuse/cloud/muddy the issue (= make an issue more difficult to understand or deal with than it needs to be ) You must not let your feelings cloud the issue.','highlight an issue (= bring attention to it ) The minister used his speech to highlight the issue of global warming.','an issue comes up ( also an issue arises formal ) (= people started to discuss it ) The issue arose during a meeting of the Budget Committee.','the issues surrounding something This chapter discusses the ethical issues surrounding genetically modified foods.','a political/social/economic etc issue They discussed a number of political issues.','an important issue The committee met several times to discuss this important issue.','a key/major/big issue (= very important ) For me, the big issue is cost.','a difficult/complex issue He was able to grasp complex issues quickly.','a controversial/sensitive issue (= an issue that causes strong feelings and arguments ) Abortion is a controversial issue.','a thorny issue ( also a vexed issue formal ) (= a difficult one that causes disagreement ) Illegal immigration is always a thorny issue.','a burning issue (= a very important and urgent issue ) For country-dwellers, transport is a burning issue.','wider issues (= more general issues, that affect more people or things ) This is a question that raises much wider issues.','a topical issue (= an issue that is important at the present time ) The magazine discusses topical issues in science.','the underlying issue (= the cause, or a more important problem that is related to something ) This research explores some of the underlying issues related to high unemployment.','a fundamental issue (= a basic and important issue ) Decisions still need to be made about some fundamental issues.','an unresolved issue (= that has not been dealt with ) A number of unresolved issues remain before the treaty can be signed.','a range of issues A range of issues were debated at the meeting.','something is not the issue spoken (= something is not the most important problem or part ) Price alone is not the issue.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Abortion is a highly controversial issue.","translation":"سقط جنین یک موضوع بسیار بحث برانگیز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973447.mp3"},{"sentence":"We should raise the issue of discrimination with the council.","translation":"ما باید موضوع تبعیض را در شورا مطرح کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973448.mp3"},{"sentence":"The key issue is whether workers should be classified as ‘employees’.","translation":"مسئله کلیدی این است که آیا کارگران باید به عنوان \"کارمند\" طبقه بندی شوند یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001973467.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('85f0918c-1a3a-5fc5-a62e-238ec4f3102e','a122cbe4-a9af-5f4f-a81d-6e75beb3c95d',2,'magazine','مجله','spoken & written','a magazine or newspaper printed for a particular day, week, or month','[ countable ]',null,'مجله یا روزنامه ای که برای یک روز، هفته یا ماه خاص چاپ می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['discuss/debate an issue They met to discuss the issue of working conditions at the factory.','raise an issue/bring up an issue (= say an issue should be discussed ) Some important issues were raised at the meeting.','deal with/tackle an issue ( also address an issue formal ) The government must deal with the issue of gun crime. The company said that it will address the issue at the next scheduled board meeting.','decide/settle/resolve an issue (= solve it ) The issue was settled after some tough negotiations. No deadline has been set to resolve the issue.','face an issue (= accept that an issue exists and deal with it ) Politicians seem to be reluctant to face the issue.','avoid/evade an issue ( also dodge/duck an issue informal ) (= avoid discussing an issue ) There is no point in evading the issue any longer.','confuse/cloud/muddy the issue (= make an issue more difficult to understand or deal with than it needs to be ) You must not let your feelings cloud the issue.','highlight an issue (= bring attention to it ) The minister used his speech to highlight the issue of global warming.','an issue comes up ( also an issue arises formal ) (= people started to discuss it ) The issue arose during a meeting of the Budget Committee.','the issues surrounding something This chapter discusses the ethical issues surrounding genetically modified foods.','a political/social/economic etc issue They discussed a number of political issues.','an important issue The committee met several times to discuss this important issue.','a key/major/big issue (= very important ) For me, the big issue is cost.','a difficult/complex issue He was able to grasp complex issues quickly.','a controversial/sensitive issue (= an issue that causes strong feelings and arguments ) Abortion is a controversial issue.','a thorny issue ( also a vexed issue formal ) (= a difficult one that causes disagreement ) Illegal immigration is always a thorny issue.','a burning issue (= a very important and urgent issue ) For country-dwellers, transport is a burning issue.','wider issues (= more general issues, that affect more people or things ) This is a question that raises much wider issues.','a topical issue (= an issue that is important at the present time ) The magazine discusses topical issues in science.','the underlying issue (= the cause, or a more important problem that is related to something ) This research explores some of the underlying issues related to high unemployment.','a fundamental issue (= a basic and important issue ) Decisions still need to be made about some fundamental issues.','an unresolved issue (= that has not been dealt with ) A number of unresolved issues remain before the treaty can be signed.','a range of issues A range of issues were debated at the meeting.','something is not the issue spoken (= something is not the most important problem or part ) Price alone is not the issue.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The article appeared in the January issue of ‘Nature’.","translation":"این مقاله در شماره ژانویه \"Nature\" منتشر شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00511.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have you seen the latest issue?","translation":"آیا آخرین شماره را دیده اید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001723501.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
