('7e012dce-0738-5d57-a4af-8296e2c6d0c4','ffdace99-5158-5ebc-8667-4b5a500ed7dd',1,'natural/artificial light','نور طبیعی/مصنوعی','spoken & written','the energy from the Sun, a flame , a lamp etc that allows you to see things','[ uncountable ]',null,'نور، روشنایی؛ چراغ؛ ترافیک (چراغ‌ها)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['bright/strong The light was so bright he had to shut his eyes.','blinding/dazzling (= extremely bright ) The white buildings reflected a blinding light.','dim (= not bright ) Gradually her eyes became accustomed to the dim light.','good (= bright enough ) Stand over here where the light is good.','poor/bad (= not bright enough ) The light was too poor for me to read.','soft/warm (= light that seems slightly yellow or orange ) the soft light of the candles','cold/harsh (= light that seems slightly blue ) the cold light of the moon','the morning/dawn light The flowers glowed brightly in the morning light.','natural light (= light produced by the sun ) The only natural light came from two high windows.','artificial light (= light produced by lamps ) The office was windowless, lit only by artificial light.','light shines The light from the streetlamp shone through the curtains.','light comes from somewhere The only light came from the fire.','light streams/floods in (= a large amount of light comes in ) Light streamed in through the window.','light falls on/across etc something The light fell on her book.','light illuminates something formal (= makes it bright or able to be seen ) The light from the screen illuminated the people gathered round it.','the light is fading (= it is getting darker as the sun is going down )','produce light ( also emit light technical ) the light produced by the sun','cast light (= send light onto something ) the gold circle of light cast by the lamp','reflect light Snow reflects a lot of light.','something is bathed in light literary (= something has a lot of light shining on it ) The fields and woods were bathed in golden light.','a beam/ray/shaft of light (= a thin line of light ) There was a shaft of light from the doorway.','a flash of light (= a bright light that appears suddenly for a very short time ) A flash of light caught his attention.','a pool/circle of light (= an area of light ) They stood in the pool of light cast by the streetlamp.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We saw a flash of light.","translation":"یک فلش نور دیدیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000946.mp3"},{"sentence":"Everything looked grey in the dim light of the oil lamp.","translation":"در نور کم چراغ نفت همه چیز خاکستری به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000947.mp3"},{"sentence":"I read by the light of the fire.","translation":"با نور آتش خواندم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000948.mp3"},{"sentence":"The man moved forward into the light.","translation":"مرد به سمت نور حرکت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797674.mp3"},{"sentence":"The colours look different in different lights.","translation":"رنگ ها در نورهای مختلف متفاوت به نظر می رسند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001532784.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('c4b666d5-1827-5234-a496-91057eaa032f','ffdace99-5158-5ebc-8667-4b5a500ed7dd',2,'lamp/electric light etc','لامپ / چراغ برق و غیره','spoken & written','something that produces light, especially electric light, to help you to see','[ countable ]','the bright lights','چیزی که نور تولید می کند، به ویژه نور الکتریکی، تا به شما کمک کند تا ببینید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['bright/strong The light was so bright he had to shut his eyes.','blinding/dazzling (= extremely bright ) The white buildings reflected a blinding light.','dim (= not bright ) Gradually her eyes became accustomed to the dim light.','good (= bright enough ) Stand over here where the light is good.','poor/bad (= not bright enough ) The light was too poor for me to read.','soft/warm (= light that seems slightly yellow or orange ) the soft light of the candles','cold/harsh (= light that seems slightly blue ) the cold light of the moon','the morning/dawn light The flowers glowed brightly in the morning light.','natural light (= light produced by the sun ) The only natural light came from two high windows.','artificial light (= light produced by lamps ) The office was windowless, lit only by artificial light.','light shines The light from the streetlamp shone through the curtains.','light comes from somewhere The only light came from the fire.','light streams/floods in (= a large amount of light comes in ) Light streamed in through the window.','light falls on/across etc something The light fell on her book.','light illuminates something formal (= makes it bright or able to be seen ) The light from the screen illuminated the people gathered round it.','the light is fading (= it is getting darker as the sun is going down )','produce light ( also emit light technical ) the light produced by the sun','cast light (= send light onto something ) the gold circle of light cast by the lamp','reflect light Snow reflects a lot of light.','something is bathed in light literary (= something has a lot of light shining on it ) The fields and woods were bathed in golden light.','a beam/ray/shaft of light (= a thin line of light ) There was a shaft of light from the doorway.','a flash of light (= a bright light that appears suddenly for a very short time ) A flash of light caught his attention.','a pool/circle of light (= an area of light ) They stood in the pool of light cast by the streetlamp.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Ahead of us we could see the lights of the city.","translation":"جلوتر از ما می توانستیم چراغ های شهر را ببینیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001532819.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re having a mixture of wall lights and ceiling lights in different parts of the house.","translation":"ما مخلوطی از چراغ های دیواری و چراغ های سقفی را در قسمت های مختلف خانه داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797675.mp3"},{"sentence":"I switched on the light in the bedroom.","translation":"چراغ اتاق خواب را روشن کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001532823.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t forget to switch the lights off when you go out.","translation":"فراموش نکنید که هنگام بیرون رفتن چراغ ها را خاموش کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797678.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you turn the light out downstairs?","translation":"آیا می توانید چراغ را در طبقه پایین خاموش کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797681.mp3"},{"sentence":"The lights in the office were still on.","translation":"چراغ های دفتر هنوز روشن بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797682.mp3"},{"sentence":"The street lights were just beginning to come on.","translation":"چراغ های خیابان تازه داشت روشن می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001532831.mp3"},{"sentence":"He left a light on in the kitchen.","translation":"چراغی را در آشپزخانه روشن گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797683.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make sure all the lights are off when you leave.","translation":"هنگام خروج مطمئن شوید که همه چراغ ها خاموش هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797684.mp3"},{"sentence":"Suddenly all the lights in the house went out .","translation":"ناگهان تمام چراغ های خانه خاموش شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001532834.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you turn the light down (= make it less bright ) a bit?","translation":"آیا می توانید نور را کم کنید (= نور آن را کمتر کنید)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001797690.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shine a light over here, will you?","translation":"نوری به اینجا بتابان، می‌خواهی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001532857.mp3"}]'::jsonb,12),
