('0107bc53-2dea-54f6-800f-01119066a960','03fe44d5-d60e-52b3-99b6-f0c4d93d4216',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the power to make impossible things happen by saying special words or doing special actions',null,'black magic , white magic','جادو، سحر؛ شیرینی (جادویی)؛ مهر (فریب)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do magic In the story, the children are not allowed to do magic out of school.','work magic (= do magic ) What do you expect me to do? I can’t work magic!','use magic By using magic, he can order the ghost of any dead person to be his servant.','black magic (= intended to harm people ) The candles had been used for black magic.','ancient magic The place seemed full of shadows and ancient magic.','strong/powerful magic Her fingers moved to make the sign that protected against strong magic.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you believe in magic?","translation":"آیا شما به جادو اعتقاد دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000172166.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('ff4c3bd4-430e-5c02-a080-89586c7c1f70','03fe44d5-d60e-52b3-99b6-f0c4d93d4216',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a special, attractive , or exciting quality',null,null,'یک کیفیت خاص، جذاب یا هیجان انگیز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['do magic In the story, the children are not allowed to do magic out of school.','work magic (= do magic ) What do you expect me to do? I can’t work magic!','use magic By using magic, he can order the ghost of any dead person to be his servant.','black magic (= intended to harm people ) The candles had been used for black magic.','ancient magic The place seemed full of shadows and ancient magic.','strong/powerful magic Her fingers moved to make the sign that protected against strong magic.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Paris has lost some of its magic for me over the years.","translation":"پاریس در طول این سال ها بخشی از جادوی خود را برای من از دست داده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000172179.mp3"},{"sentence":"the magic of Christmas","translation":"جادوی کریسمس","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000987.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
