('87133e4e-ff4a-5f92-9e74-009c1ea08a2d','3c409e5b-dfd3-50d2-92f8-c9f6a28836cb',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the media','رسانه‌ها، مطبوعات؛ رسانه (جمع medium)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the national/local media The case received enormous publicity in the national media.','the news media Does the news media have a role in forming public opinion?','the mass media (= television, newspapers etc, which are seen by many people ) The mass media has helped to call attention to environmental issues.','the mainstream/popular media (= television, newspapers etc, that most people are able to see or read ) Few of these events were reported in the mainstream media.','media attention/coverage/interest etc The tragedy received worldwide media attention.','a media campaign (= when something is deliberately reported or advertised in the media a lot ) a media campaign aimed at reducing drunk driving','a media blitz (= when something is deliberately reported or advertised in the media a lot, in a small amount of time ) The candidate’s media blitz has certainly raised his profile in the election.','media hype (= when the media give something too much attention and try to make it seem more important or better than it really is ) the media hype surrounding the match against France','a media circus (= a disapproving phrase for all the people from the media who report events, and all the attention they give to these events ) There is likely to be a media circus outside the courtroom.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2d861fd0-2a76-56d2-8bab-c41c6d691dab','3c409e5b-dfd3-50d2-92f8-c9f6a28836cb',2,null,null,'spoken & written','the plural of medium',null,'mass media , multimedia','جمع متوسط','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the national/local media The case received enormous publicity in the national media.','the news media Does the news media have a role in forming public opinion?','the mass media (= television, newspapers etc, which are seen by many people ) The mass media has helped to call attention to environmental issues.','the mainstream/popular media (= television, newspapers etc, that most people are able to see or read ) Few of these events were reported in the mainstream media.','media attention/coverage/interest etc The tragedy received worldwide media attention.','a media campaign (= when something is deliberately reported or advertised in the media a lot ) a media campaign aimed at reducing drunk driving','a media blitz (= when something is deliberately reported or advertised in the media a lot, in a small amount of time ) The candidate’s media blitz has certainly raised his profile in the election.','media hype (= when the media give something too much attention and try to make it seem more important or better than it really is ) the media hype surrounding the match against France','a media circus (= a disapproving phrase for all the people from the media who report events, and all the attention they give to these events ) There is likely to be a media circus outside the courtroom.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('890c396b-fefc-5503-bdb0-67c3045abeae','98d820af-b4d3-5345-8854-c72d2f5563f0',1,null,null,'spoken & written','dirty or untidy',null,null,'شلخت، کثیف؛ به‌هم‌ریخته (حالت)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a messy room","translation":"یک اتاق به هم ریخته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001661486.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sorry the place is so messy, I haven’t had time to clear up.","translation":"متاسفم که مکان خیلی نامرتب است، من وقت نکردم پاک کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000224172.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('7d1924f9-cec4-5d35-9ac2-6ba5e9343da6','98d820af-b4d3-5345-8854-c72d2f5563f0',2,null,null,'informal','a messy situation is complicated and unpleasant to deal with',null,null,'یک موقعیت نامرتب پیچیده و ناخوشایند است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He’s just been through a particularly messy divorce.","translation":"او به تازگی یک طلاق به خصوص کثیف را پشت سر گذاشته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000224177.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
