('70f9ddc0-5ff2-5078-b4d5-38110cd73975','3853525b-6ed9-5467-86fd-4359a7d6d305',1,null,null,'spoken & written','one of the 12 named periods of time that a year is divided into',null,null,'ماه، ماه (تقویم)؛ ماه (خورشید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['last month The new restaurant opened last month.','the past month They had come to know and like each other in the past month.','the previous/preceding month (= the month before ) Sales were lower than in the previous month.','next month The movie will be released next month.','the coming months (= the next few months ) Further work is planned for the coming months.','the following month (= the next month ) By the following month he had raised over £400.','the summer/autumn/winter/spring months It’s very cold here during the winter months.','a calendar month (= one of the 12 months of the year ) We get paid on the last day of the calendar month.','in recent months He had started to drink heavily in recent months.','the beginning/end/middle of the month You’ll receive your wages at the end of the month.','the time of the month This is the busiest time of the month.','the months of the year We’re learning the months of the year in German.','a month passes/goes by Seven months went by before he returned.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Phil is coming home for a visit next month.","translation":"فیل ماه آینده برای ملاقات به خانه می آید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000208251.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’ll be thirteen this month.","translation":"او این ماه سیزده ساله خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000208252.mp3"},{"sentence":"I hope I’ll have finished the work by the end of the month .","translation":"امیدوارم تا پایان ماه کار را تمام کرده باشم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000208253.mp3"},{"sentence":"She earns about £350 a month (= each month ) .","translation":"او حدود 350 پوند در ماه (= هر ماه) درآمد دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554731.mp3"},{"sentence":"We update the schedule at least once a month.","translation":"ما برنامه را حداقل یک بار در ماه به روز می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001817422.mp3"},{"sentence":"It snowed heavily during the month of January.","translation":"در ماه ژانویه برف شدیدی بارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000208250.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('6d5e7c05-3f06-550f-aa3a-71abc0c80cc2','3853525b-6ed9-5467-86fd-4359a7d6d305',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a period of about four weeks',null,null,'یک دوره حدود چهار هفته','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['last month The new restaurant opened last month.','the past month They had come to know and like each other in the past month.','the previous/preceding month (= the month before ) Sales were lower than in the previous month.','next month The movie will be released next month.','the coming months (= the next few months ) Further work is planned for the coming months.','the following month (= the next month ) By the following month he had raised over £400.','the summer/autumn/winter/spring months It’s very cold here during the winter months.','a calendar month (= one of the 12 months of the year ) We get paid on the last day of the calendar month.','in recent months He had started to drink heavily in recent months.','the beginning/end/middle of the month You’ll receive your wages at the end of the month.','the time of the month This is the busiest time of the month.','the months of the year We’re learning the months of the year in German.','a month passes/goes by Seven months went by before he returned.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She has an eight-month-old daughter.","translation":"او یک دختر هشت ماهه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000208257.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’ll be away for two months.","translation":"او دو ماه دور خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000208258.mp3"},{"sentence":"The symptoms she suffered varied from month to month (= every few weeks she had different medical problems ) .","translation":"علائمی که او از ماه به ماه رنج می برد متفاوت بود (= هر چند هفته یکبار مشکلات پزشکی متفاوتی داشت).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001554732.mp3"},{"sentence":"a month-long transport strike","translation":"اعتصاب یک ماهه حمل و نقل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001758749.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('af344bbe-0670-541d-b271-f29d216e1333','3853525b-6ed9-5467-86fd-4359a7d6d305',3,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'months','ماه، ماه (تقویم)؛ ماه (خورشید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['last month The new restaurant opened last month.','the past month They had come to know and like each other in the past month.','the previous/preceding month (= the month before ) Sales were lower than in the previous month.','next month The movie will be released next month.','the coming months (= the next few months ) Further work is planned for the coming months.','the following month (= the next month ) By the following month he had raised over £400.','the summer/autumn/winter/spring months It’s very cold here during the winter months.','a calendar month (= one of the 12 months of the year ) We get paid on the last day of the calendar month.','in recent months He had started to drink heavily in recent months.','the beginning/end/middle of the month You’ll receive your wages at the end of the month.','the time of the month This is the busiest time of the month.','the months of the year We’re learning the months of the year in German.','a month passes/goes by Seven months went by before he returned.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
