('0f50d8ba-d34d-502c-b9a8-17591b50c27b','3853525b-6ed9-5467-86fd-4359a7d6d305',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'never/not in a month of Sundays','ماه، ماه (تقویم)؛ ماه (خورشید)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['last month The new restaurant opened last month.','the past month They had come to know and like each other in the past month.','the previous/preceding month (= the month before ) Sales were lower than in the previous month.','next month The movie will be released next month.','the coming months (= the next few months ) Further work is planned for the coming months.','the following month (= the next month ) By the following month he had raised over £400.','the summer/autumn/winter/spring months It’s very cold here during the winter months.','a calendar month (= one of the 12 months of the year ) We get paid on the last day of the calendar month.','in recent months He had started to drink heavily in recent months.','the beginning/end/middle of the month You’ll receive your wages at the end of the month.','the time of the month This is the busiest time of the month.','the months of the year We’re learning the months of the year in German.','a month passes/goes by Seven months went by before he returned.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('2d2330d4-aeb8-5503-8b12-f285089e2f8d','14579050-3a54-5e48-965e-6ea17070e8cc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','relating to the principles of what is right and wrong behaviour , and with the difference between good and evil','[ only before noun ]',null,'اخلاقی، اخلاقی‌منش؛ اخلاقی (درس)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a moral standard/principle Has there been a decline in moral standards in our society?','a moral value (= behaviour that a society believes is right and good ) Schools teach moral values both by example and in lessons.','a moral duty/obligation (= something you must do for moral reasons ) If you have a pet, you have a moral obligation to take care of it.','a moral judgment We shouldn''t make moral judgements about the way other people live their lives.','a moral imperative (= something that must be done for moral reasons ) He felt that rescuing the hostages was a moral imperative.','a moral code (= a set of beliefs about right and wrong that influences your behaviour ) His own moral code is based on his religious beliefs.','somebody’s moral authority (= influence that someone has because people believe their principles are right ) Corruption in government destroys its moral authority.','moral fibre British English , moral fiber American English (= the emotional strength to do what is right ) Single parents are sometimes treated as though they lack moral fibre.','a moral issue a debate on the moral issues surrounding the use of animals in medical research','a moral dilemma (= a difficult decision for moral reasons ) Doctors face a moral dilemma when a patient can be kept alive but has no chance of real recovery.','somebody’s moral sense (= a feeling for what is right and what is wrong ) Children’s moral sense develops over a number of years.','moral superiority (= the idea that you are morally right and other people are not ) He connects high social class with moral superiority.','moral philosophy (= the study of moral principles and rules ) a class in moral philosophy','the moral order (= the way societies are organized according to moral standards ) Hitler posed the greatest threat to the moral order of the world that history has ever seen.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"It is easy to have an opinion on a moral issue like the death penalty for murder.","translation":"به راحتی می توان در مورد یک موضوع اخلاقی مانند مجازات اعدام برای قتل نظر داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534801.mp3"},{"sentence":"moral philosophy","translation":"فلسفه اخلاق","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534805.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think you can run a business to the highest moral standards.","translation":"من فکر می کنم شما می توانید یک کسب و کار را با بالاترین استانداردهای اخلاقی اداره کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001754973.mp3"},{"sentence":"If we accept that certain babies should be allowed to die, we place doctors in a moral dilemma .","translation":"اگر بپذیریم که برخی از نوزادان باید بمیرند، پزشکان را در یک دوراهی اخلاقی قرار می دهیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534812.mp3"},{"sentence":"Man is gifted with a moral sense by which he distinguishes good from evil.","translation":"انسان دارای یک حس اخلاقی است که به وسیله آن خوب را از بد تشخیص می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534816.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('510d285a-9887-58cd-bfbf-cf5ddbbeb8b1','14579050-3a54-5e48-965e-6ea17070e8cc',2,null,null,'spoken & written','based on your ideas about what is right, rather than on what is legal or practical','[ only before noun ]',null,'بر اساس ایده های شما در مورد آنچه درست است، نه بر اساس آنچه که قانونی یا عملی است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a moral standard/principle Has there been a decline in moral standards in our society?','a moral value (= behaviour that a society believes is right and good ) Schools teach moral values both by example and in lessons.','a moral duty/obligation (= something you must do for moral reasons ) If you have a pet, you have a moral obligation to take care of it.','a moral judgment We shouldn''t make moral judgements about the way other people live their lives.','a moral imperative (= something that must be done for moral reasons ) He felt that rescuing the hostages was a moral imperative.','a moral code (= a set of beliefs about right and wrong that influences your behaviour ) His own moral code is based on his religious beliefs.','somebody’s moral authority (= influence that someone has because people believe their principles are right ) Corruption in government destroys its moral authority.','moral fibre British English , moral fiber American English (= the emotional strength to do what is right ) Single parents are sometimes treated as though they lack moral fibre.','a moral issue a debate on the moral issues surrounding the use of animals in medical research','a moral dilemma (= a difficult decision for moral reasons ) Doctors face a moral dilemma when a patient can be kept alive but has no chance of real recovery.','somebody’s moral sense (= a feeling for what is right and what is wrong ) Children’s moral sense develops over a number of years.','moral superiority (= the idea that you are morally right and other people are not ) He connects high social class with moral superiority.','moral philosophy (= the study of moral principles and rules ) a class in moral philosophy','the moral order (= the way societies are organized according to moral standards ) Hitler posed the greatest threat to the moral order of the world that history has ever seen.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The book places a high moral value on marriage and the family unit.","translation":"این کتاب ارزش اخلاقی بالایی برای ازدواج و کانون خانواده قائل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534821.mp3"},{"sentence":"The UN feels that it has the moral authority (= influence because people accept that its beliefs are right ) to send troops to the area.","translation":"سازمان ملل احساس می کند که اقتدار اخلاقی دارد (= نفوذ زیرا مردم می پذیرند که اعتقاداتش درست است) برای اعزام نیرو به منطقه.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000209251.mp3"},{"sentence":"A man has a moral duty to obey the law.","translation":"مرد وظیفه اخلاقی دارد که قانون را رعایت کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534829.mp3"},{"sentence":"It isn’t just lack of moral fibre (= lack of the emotional strength to do what you believe is right ) which leads to a rising divorce rate.","translation":"فقط فقدان فیبر اخلاقی (= فقدان قدرت عاطفی برای انجام کاری که فکر می کنید درست است) نیست که منجر به افزایش نرخ طلاق می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001534830.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
