('655bb652-fa6a-573c-877a-eddfdd1452d3','2e7bf874-779f-5b93-b215-8a0fa349a8d7',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a series of sounds made by instruments or voices in a way that is pleasant or exciting',null,null,'موسیقی، نغمه؛ نوت (موسیقی)؛ نت‌ها','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['listen to music Ella was listening to music on her iPod.','play music A small band was playing jazz music.','write/compose music He composed the music for the ‘Lord of the Rings’ films.','make music (= play or compose music ) We began making music together about five years ago.','loud/soft/quiet They were kept awake by loud music from next door.','pop/rock/classical etc music Johnny Cash was one of country music’s greatest stars.','live music (= played by musicians on stage ) Most of the bars have live music.','recorded music Live music can sound very different from recorded music.','background music (= that you hear but do not listen to ) the soft background music in the restaurant','choral music (= sung by choirs ) We perform a wide variety of choral music.','instrumental music (= with no singing ) a programme of instrumental music','chamber music (= classical music played by a small group of musicians ) a performance of Schumann’s chamber music','orchestral music (= classical music played by a large group of musicians ) He has a large CD collection, mostly orchestral music.','piano/organ music I love listening to piano music.','a music lover For music lovers, the city has two world-famous orchestras. Her recordings delighted music lovers.','a piece of music It’s a beautiful piece of music.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I often listen to classical music when I’m in the car.","translation":"من اغلب وقتی در ماشین هستم به موسیقی کلاسیک گوش می دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001071.mp3"},{"sentence":"A new piece of music was specially written for the occasion.","translation":"یک قطعه موسیقی جدید به طور ویژه برای این مناسبت نوشته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001555900.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
