('7345843c-1412-5729-95f4-826585aff62e','807e209b-e21c-5886-8082-3560c677075e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a statement saying that you are willing to do something for someone or give them something',null,null,'پیشنهاد، عرضه؛ پیشنهاد (قیمت)؛ پیشکش','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer (= say yes to it ) Are you going to accept their offer?','take up an offer/take somebody up on their offer British English (= accept someone''s offer ) I might take him up on his offer.','turn down/refuse/reject/decline an offer (= say no to it ) She declined the offer of a lift.','get/receive an offer He received the offer of a place at Cambridge University.','withdraw an offer They suddenly withdrew their offer at the last minute.','a job offer I still did not have a formal job offer.','a kind/generous offer We are grateful for your kind offer. They were surprised by his generous offer to let them stay at his place.','an offer of help/support/friendship etc Any offers of help would be appreciated.','I appreciate your offer (= I am grateful for it – used especially when politely refusing someone''s offer ) I appreciate your offer, but I don’t need any help.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t turn down the offer of a free trip to Milan!","translation":"من نمی توانم پیشنهاد سفر رایگان به میلان را رد کنم!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000393049.mp3"},{"sentence":"His offer to resign will be accepted.","translation":"پیشنهاد استعفای وی پذیرفته می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762330.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('61e254b2-5f20-5b4f-89aa-b7c709be5ec9','807e209b-e21c-5886-8082-3560c677075e',2,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of money that you are willing to pay for something',null,'o.n.o.','مقدار پولی که شما حاضرید برای چیزی بپردازید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer (= say yes to it ) Are you going to accept their offer?','take up an offer/take somebody up on their offer British English (= accept someone''s offer ) I might take him up on his offer.','turn down/refuse/reject/decline an offer (= say no to it ) She declined the offer of a lift.','get/receive an offer He received the offer of a place at Cambridge University.','withdraw an offer They suddenly withdrew their offer at the last minute.','a job offer I still did not have a formal job offer.','a kind/generous offer We are grateful for your kind offer. They were surprised by his generous offer to let them stay at his place.','an offer of help/support/friendship etc Any offers of help would be appreciated.','I appreciate your offer (= I am grateful for it – used especially when politely refusing someone''s offer ) I appreciate your offer, but I don’t need any help.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Will you accept their offer ?","translation":"آیا پیشنهاد آنها را می پذیرید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762331.mp3"},{"sentence":"Within 20 minutes they were prepared to make us an offer.","translation":"در عرض 20 دقیقه آنها آماده شدند تا به ما پیشنهاد بدهند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762338.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company made an offer of $5 million for the site.","translation":"این شرکت پیشنهادی 5 میلیون دلاری برای سایت ارائه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000393055.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘I’ll be interested if Newcastle make me a good offer, ’ said the 25-year-old striker.","translation":"مهاجم 25 ساله گفت: اگر نیوکاسل به من پیشنهاد خوبی بدهد، علاقه مند خواهم بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565901.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re asking £2,500, but we’re open to offers.","translation":"ما ۲۵۰۰ پوند می‌خواهیم، ​​اما آماده پیشنهادات هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000393062.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('ae909d0c-050f-53f7-8e01-016874f861ac','807e209b-e21c-5886-8082-3560c677075e',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a reduction of the price of something in a shop for a short time',null,null,'کاهش قیمت چیزی در یک مغازه برای مدت کوتاه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['accept an offer (= say yes to it ) Are you going to accept their offer?','take up an offer/take somebody up on their offer British English (= accept someone''s offer ) I might take him up on his offer.','turn down/refuse/reject/decline an offer (= say no to it ) She declined the offer of a lift.','get/receive an offer He received the offer of a place at Cambridge University.','withdraw an offer They suddenly withdrew their offer at the last minute.','a job offer I still did not have a formal job offer.','a kind/generous offer We are grateful for your kind offer. They were surprised by his generous offer to let them stay at his place.','an offer of help/support/friendship etc Any offers of help would be appreciated.','I appreciate your offer (= I am grateful for it – used especially when politely refusing someone''s offer ) I appreciate your offer, but I don’t need any help.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"All special offers advertised in this brochure are subject to availability.","translation":"همه پیشنهادات ویژه آگهی شده در این بروشور مشروط به در دسترس بودن است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565902.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s a free offer on orders over £45.","translation":"برای سفارشات بیش از 45 پوند یک پیشنهاد رایگان وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001762350.mp3"},{"sentence":"To take advantage of this offer (= buy something at the reduced price ) , complete the attached forms.","translation":"برای استفاده از این پیشنهاد (= خرید چیزی با قیمت کاهش یافته) فرم های پیوست را تکمیل کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001565905.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
