('a739c8fc-14f3-52fb-9ae3-10061721d83f','fc869d97-927a-53bb-aa75-e701b51e3cf2',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a round white vegetable with a brown , red , or white skin and many layers . Onions have a strong taste and smell',null,null,'پیاز، پیازچه (بادمجان)؛ پیاز (خام)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Chop the onions finely.","translation":"پیازها را ریز خرد کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558143.mp3"},{"sentence":"red onions","translation":"پیاز قرمز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001761061.mp3"},{"sentence":"home-made onion soup","translation":"سوپ پیاز خانگی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001558144.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('ac484d2f-20d1-5919-afc9-6b6dafefd770','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',1,'for a purpose','برای یک هدف','formal','for the purpose of doing something',null,null,'ترتیب، نظم؛ دستور؛ سفارش؛ مرتبه (رتبه)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Samuel trained every day in order to improve his performance.","translation":"ساموئل هر روز تمرین می کرد تا عملکرد خود را بهبود بخشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713617.mp3"},{"sentence":"In order to understand how the human body works, you need to have some knowledge of chemistry.","translation":"برای اینکه بفهمید بدن انسان چگونه کار می کند، باید کمی دانش شیمی داشته باشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713618.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sunlight is needed in order for the process of photosynthesis to take place in plants.","translation":"نور خورشید برای انجام فرآیند فتوسنتز در گیاهان مورد نیاز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713623.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('76a8ba22-53ad-5e26-bceb-ab20c7a4a67e','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',2,'arrangement','ترتیب','spoken & written','the way that things or events are arranged in relation to each other, so that one thing is first, another thing is second etc','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'نحوه چیدمان چیزها یا رویدادها نسبت به یکدیگر، به طوری که یک چیز اول، چیز دیگر در درجه دوم و غیره',array['sequence']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the right/correct order Of course, the notes must be played in the right order.','the wrong order The pages had been put in the wrong order.','the same order He always closed the windows in the same order.','reverse order They announced the results in reverse order, starting with the last.','alphabetical order List the names in alphabetical order.','numerical order The dogs are given numbers, and stand in numerical order while the judge looks at them.','chronological order (= the order that things happened in time ) The paintings are arranged in chronological order.','ascending/descending order (= with the lowest or highest number first ) The films are ranked in ascending order of profitability.','a logical order Put the events of the story into a logical order.','put/arrange something in order Decide what points you want to talk about, and put them in order.','in order of importance/priority/preference etc The country’s main exports were, in order of importance, coffee, sugar, and soya beans.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Make sure that you put the books back in the right order .","translation":"مطمئن شوید که کتاب‌ها را به ترتیب درست برگردانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040160.mp3"},{"sentence":"The files are all out of order.","translation":"فایل ها همگی از کار افتاده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040161.mp3"},{"sentence":"Then they call out our names in order and we answer yes or no.","translation":"سپس به ترتیب نام ما را صدا می زنند و ما پاسخ می دهیم بله یا خیر.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000268533.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their names are arranged in alphabetical order .","translation":"نام آنها به ترتیب حروف الفبا مرتب شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040162.mp3"},{"sentence":"The cities are listed in order of importance.","translation":"شهرها به ترتیب اهمیت فهرست شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040163.mp3"},{"sentence":"Students learn the verbs in order of difficulty.","translation":"دانش آموزان افعال را به ترتیب سختی یاد می گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713631.mp3"},{"sentence":"The prices are given in ascending order.","translation":"قیمت ها به صورت صعودی ارائه شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040164.mp3"},{"sentence":"She read out the names in reverse order.","translation":"او اسامی را به ترتیب معکوس خواند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040165.mp3"},{"sentence":"There seemed to be no logical order to the sections.","translation":"به نظر می رسید هیچ نظم منطقی در بخش ها وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040166.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('1de76795-0e3a-55e7-a245-961b26223eae','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',3,'instruction','دستورالعمل','spoken & written','an instruction to do something that is given by someone in authority','[ countable usually plural ]',null,'دستوری برای انجام کاری که توسط شخص صاحب مقام داده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The captain had to give the order to abandon ship.","translation":"کاپیتان مجبور شد دستور ترک کشتی را بدهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713654.mp3"},{"sentence":"She is under orders to have a complete rest.","translation":"او تحت دستور استراحت کامل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001142.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was thrown into the river on the emperor’s orders.","translation":"به دستور امپراتور او را به رودخانه انداختند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa001143.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company cannot be identified by order of the court.","translation":"با حکم دادگاه نمی توان شرکت را شناسایی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001969869.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('aa3fb098-6836-5b27-92a9-5c2f222d1109','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',4,'controlled situation','وضعیت کنترل شده','spoken & written','a situation in which rules are obeyed and authority is respected','[ uncountable ]',null,'وضعیتی که در آن قوانین رعایت می شود و اقتدار رعایت می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"the breakdown of law and order","translation":"فروپاشی نظم و قانون","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713694.mp3"},{"sentence":"The riots are a threat to public order .","translation":"شورش ها تهدیدی برای نظم عمومی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713697.mp3"},{"sentence":"The physics teacher couldn’t keep order in any class.","translation":"معلم فیزیک نمی توانست نظم را در هیچ کلاسی حفظ کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000268605.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had trouble keeping her teenage sons in order.","translation":"او در نظم دادن به پسران نوجوانش مشکل داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000268606.mp3"},{"sentence":"The army was called in to restore order .","translation":"ارتش برای برقراری نظم فراخوانده شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000268609.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('459e6226-ee3a-537b-b80a-7b8b77fb3c4f','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',5,'well-organized state','دولت به خوبی سازماندهی شده','spoken & written','a situation in which everything is controlled, well organized , and correctly arranged','[ uncountable ]',null,'موقعیتی که در آن همه چیز کنترل شده، به خوبی سازماندهی شده و به درستی مرتب شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Let’s have some order in here.","translation":"بیایید در اینجا کمی نظم داشته باشیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000268710.mp3"},{"sentence":"You need to put your financial affairs in order .","translation":"شما باید به امور مالی خود نظم دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713701.mp3"},{"sentence":"She keeps her room in good order .","translation":"اتاقش را مرتب نگه می دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713707.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5c853c01-a12b-5b8c-8bdf-21005405cdd8','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',6,'for food or drink','برای غذا یا نوشیدنی','spoken & written','a request for food or drink in a restaurant or bar','[ countable ]','side order','درخواست غذا یا نوشیدنی در رستوران یا بار','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The waiter took our orders .","translation":"گارسون سفارشات ما را پذیرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713714.mp3"},{"sentence":"Last orders now please!","translation":"آخرین سفارشات الان لطفا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713723.mp3"},{"sentence":"When our order finally arrived we were very hungry indeed.","translation":"وقتی سفارش ما بالاخره رسید، واقعاً خیلی گرسنه بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713726.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('913b2cf7-3505-50c2-a5b4-5dcc73abed01','5fd668d2-ed85-53b2-b524-5bd65989ddf3',7,'for goods','برای کالا','spoken & written','a request by a customer for a company to supply goods','[ countable ]','mail order','درخواست مشتری از یک شرکت برای تامین کالا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Goods will be sent within 24 hours of receiving your order .","translation":"کالا ظرف 24 ساعت پس از دریافت سفارش شما ارسال خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713732.mp3"},{"sentence":"You can always cancel your order if you change your mind.","translation":"در صورت تغییر نظر، همیشه می توانید سفارش خود را لغو کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713738.mp3"},{"sentence":"The government has placed an order for (= asked a company to supply ) new weapons.","translation":"دولت سفارش داده است (= از یک شرکت خواسته است تا سلاح های جدید را تهیه کند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713744.mp3"},{"sentence":"Please complete the enclosed order form .","translation":"لطفا فرم سفارش ضمیمه شده را تکمیل کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713749.mp3"},{"sentence":"My bicycle is on order.","translation":"دوچرخه من سفارش داده شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713753.mp3"},{"sentence":"They make hand-made shoes to order.","translation":"به سفارش کفش های دست ساز درست می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001713761.mp3"},{"sentence":"Your order has arrived – you can collect it from the store any time.","translation":"سفارش شما رسیده است - هر زمان که بخواهید می توانید آن را از فروشگاه دریافت کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000268587.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
