('4bc7804c-8175-585e-91ae-9e70c33c74b9','85d32bab-baa6-5607-a7e0-a6621436725e',4,'newspaper/magazine','روزنامه/مجله','formal','a newspaper or magazine which gives information, news etc for an organization or group',null,null,'روزنامه یا مجله ای که اطلاعات، اخبار و غیره را برای یک سازمان یا گروه می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['internal organs (= organs inside your body ) She died after suffering serious damage to internal organs.','vital organs (= the most important organs for life, for example the heart and brain ) Luckily, the bullet passed through his body without hitting vital organs.','sexual/reproductive/sex organs the male and female sexual organs','sense/sensory organs (= the eyes, ears, nose, mouth, and skin, used to give us information about the world around us ) Our minds function through the brain, nervous system, and sense organs. As with the other sensory organs, taste is highly developed in babies at birth.','digestive organs (= the stomach, intestines etc, used to digest food ) a disorder of the digestive organs','a donor organ (= an organ from one person''s body that is put or can be put into another person''s body ) There is a chronic shortage of donor organs.','an organ transplant (= an operation to put an organ from one person’s body into another person’s body ) Up to 5,000 people are waiting for an organ transplant.','an organ donor (= someone who gives an organ for an organ transplant ) Not all patients who die are suitable as organ donors.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the official organ of the Communist Party","translation":"ارگان رسمی حزب کمونیست","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000269289.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d5209db5-d124-5aa4-9bef-ca121dcacf3c','42e2820a-624d-5637-8259-9450e814be25',1,'the second of two','دوم از دو','spoken & written','used to refer to the second of two people or things, which is not the one you already have or the one you have already mentioned',null,null,'دیگر، دومِ (دو مورد)؛ بقیه (گروه)؛ دیگران','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I can’t find my other shoe.","translation":"من نمی توانم کفش دیگرم را پیدا کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821439.mp3"},{"sentence":"One man was arrested, but the other one got away.","translation":"یک نفر دستگیر شد، اما نفر دیگر فرار کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567239.mp3"},{"sentence":"He kept shifting awkwardly from one foot to the other.","translation":"مدام به طرز ناخوشایندی از یک پا به پای دیگر جابجا می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821440.mp3"},{"sentence":"She took it for granted that each knew who the other was.","translation":"او این را بدیهی می‌پذیرفت که هر یک می‌دانست دیگری کیست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821441.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('6afd0f88-48bd-5bd8-9dc1-7397bf739c6f','42e2820a-624d-5637-8259-9450e814be25',2,'the rest','بقیه','spoken & written','used to refer to all the people or things in a group apart from the one you have already mentioned or the one that is already known about',null,null,'برای اشاره به همه افراد یا چیزهای یک گروه به غیر از افرادی که قبلاً ذکر کرده اید یا آنهایی که قبلاً در مورد آن شناخته شده است استفاده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The other hotels are all full.","translation":"بقیه هتل ها همه پر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821445.mp3"},{"sentence":"She’s much brighter than all the other children in her class.","translation":"او بسیار باهوش تر از بقیه بچه های کلاسش است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821446.mp3"},{"sentence":"I chose this coat in the end because the other ones were all too expensive.","translation":"من در نهایت این مانتو را انتخاب کردم، زیرا بقیه مانتوها بسیار گران بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001567257.mp3"},{"sentence":"I can see Julie, but where have all the others gone?","translation":"من می توانم جولی را ببینم، اما بقیه کجا رفته اند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821449.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('2d712004-3972-5a58-87fe-ef99651acaa7','42e2820a-624d-5637-8259-9450e814be25',3,'additional','اضافی','spoken & written','used to refer to additional people or things of the same kind',null,null,'برای اشاره به افراد یا چیزهای دیگر از همان نوع استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are one or two other problems I’d like to discuss.","translation":"یکی دو مشکل دیگر وجود دارد که می خواهم در مورد آن صحبت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821454.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve got some other friends I’d like to invite.","translation":"دوستان دیگری هم دارم که می خواهم دعوت کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821455.mp3"},{"sentence":"Have you any other questions?","translation":"آیا سوال دیگری دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821456.mp3"},{"sentence":"The guests included, among others, Elizabeth Taylor and Michael Jackson.","translation":"از جمله مهمانان، الیزابت تیلور و مایکل جکسون بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821463.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('3dd293f6-4b6f-59c9-9612-02bd7aa2a1c7','42e2820a-624d-5637-8259-9450e814be25',4,'different','متفاوت است','spoken & written','used to refer to a different person or thing from the one you have already mentioned or the one that is already known about',null,null,'برای اشاره به شخص یا چیزی متفاوت از آنچه قبلاً ذکر کرده اید یا چیزی که قبلاً در مورد آن شناخته شده است استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"David and Jessica were playing with two other children.","translation":"دیوید و جسیکا با دو کودک دیگر مشغول بازی بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821468.mp3"},{"sentence":"You’d better change into some other clothes.","translation":"بهتره لباسای دیگه عوض کنی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821469.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you envy other women who seem to manage their lives better?","translation":"آیا به زنان دیگری که به نظر می رسد زندگی خود را بهتر مدیریت می کنند حسادت می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821470.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can we discuss this some other time?","translation":"آیا می توانیم در این مورد یک وقت دیگر بحث کنیم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821471.mp3"},{"sentence":"There is no other job I would rather do.","translation":"کار دیگری وجود ندارد که من ترجیح می دهم انجام دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821475.mp3"},{"sentence":"Saudi Arabia produces more oil than any other country.","translation":"عربستان سعودی بیش از هر کشور دیگری نفت تولید می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821479.mp3"},{"sentence":"I hope you will learn to show more respect for others (= other people ) .","translation":"امیدوارم یاد بگیرید که به دیگران (= افراد دیگر) احترام بیشتری نشان دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821483.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some people are at greater risk than others.","translation":"برخی از افراد بیشتر از دیگران در معرض خطر هستند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001821489.mp3"}]'::jsonb,8),
